{"id":"vod_md_5572","vodId":"5572","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"守护猫娘绯鞠","name_cn":"守护猫娘绯鞠","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231003-1/174c229d2bef067177e47cb1ad750da2.jpg"},"summary":"天河优人（平川大辅 配音）是个独自生活孤苦伶仃的内向少年，对于生活，优人只希望能够平平安安的度过余生就好。可是事与愿违，在其16岁生日的那一天，一个名叫野井原绯鞠（小清水亚美 配音）的黑发女孩子出现在了他的面前，同时，亦有形状可怖的怪物对优人发起了攻击。战斗之后，绯鞠告诉惊魂未定的优人，他是“鬼斩役十二家”的后人。从前，在人妖混居的世界中，鬼斩役作为人类的守护者，发挥着坚实的作用。但随着时间的流转，他们的能力逐渐的减弱，最终，大部分鬼斩役都流落到了人界，成为了普通人中的一员。如今，妖怪的势力似乎有卷土重来之势，为此，优人必须鼓起勇气，为自己所爱的人不受伤害而努力战斗。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-13 08:00:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/kSAe9TMJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/zWpjLnXS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/5pjy7jbu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/EG2Vabae/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/6zJ63kGm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/VI09QfU0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/woIB0m11/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/VhCXljEu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/LiNZjCnp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/rvxjBvXq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/frcjFuUt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231012/pTSLFa7L/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:35.364Z"}